&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SHEGLAM&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;SHEGLAM is a global beauty brand dedicated to delivering innovative, high-quality, and affordable cosmetics. Founded in 2019, SHEGLAM quickly rose to prominence with trend-driven products, creative collaborations, and a commitment to inclusivity. With over 16 million followers worldwide, SHEGLAM is loved by Gen Z and beauty enthusiasts across more than 150 countries, both online and in over 7,000 stores. SHEGLAM continues to make beauty accessible for all, driven by real-time user feedback and a passion for creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
