&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SHEGLAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2019, SHEGLAM has quickly risen to become one of the&amp;nbsp;fastest-growing beauty brands, with a vibrant community of over 16&amp;nbsp;million followers across multiple social media platforms. Loved by Gen Z&amp;nbsp;around the world, we bring bold beauty to everyone—without the guilt or&amp;nbsp;high price tag. Our products are all about self-expression, cruelty-free&amp;nbsp;formulas, and makeup that’s fun, fearless, and accessible. At SHEGLAM,&amp;nbsp;we’re passionate about recognizing and nurturing talent, encouraging&amp;nbsp;creativity, and empowering our team to grow. Learn more about us at&amp;nbsp;sheglam.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Position Summary&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re seeking a full-time Influencer Marketing Manager for our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Los Angeles-based &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;corporate office.&amp;nbsp;This role will partner with the Global Influencer Marketing team to develop and execute influencer strategies that build creator community, strengthen brand love, and drive brand affinity. The ideal candidate is deeply engaged in the social and digital landscape, with proven experience managing paid influencer campaigns, organic gifting, and creator events. They will excel at building long-term creator relationships and measuring performance to demonstrate ROI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
