&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re seeking a p&lt;/span&gt;art-time, fixed-term attorney to support the US marketing team in our LA office. Working under the supervision of the US Legal regulatory compliance lead, they will help build regular legal processes to enhance marketing compliance.&amp;nbsp;They will also provide day-to-day legal review and advice on advertising, promotions, sweepstakes, contests, games, marketing messages, and related consumer-facing campaigns.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct legal research and prepare concise written analyses on federal and state marketing-compliance questions, as directed by the supervising attorney.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review marketing and advertising materials for regulatory compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft and review rules and disclosures for sweepstakes, contests, and games.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage compliance requirements for sweepstakes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review influencer and endorsement arrangements and contracts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Counsel on marketing communications compliance: TCPA (SMS/calling), CAN-SPAM (email), and telemarketing rules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft and review agreements related to marketing activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide practical, business-oriented risk assessments under tight campaign timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Job Requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Admitted to a US state bar (California or Washington preferred), or bar exam taken with admission pending. Until admitted, the hire works as a Law Clerk under the direct supervision of a licensed attorney.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;0-3 years of experience in legal practice.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong legal research and writing; able to turn analysis into practical guidance for marketing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Works well within a structured review process and takes direction from a supervising attorney.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with all the following requirements, with working knowledge in at least one:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Federal and state regulatory requirements for marketing activities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Federal and state consumer protection regulations&lt;/p&gt;
