&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Part-time, fixed-term employment ending on December 31, 2026. Employment is at will during the term and may be terminated at any time. The Company may, at its sole discretion, offer to renew; this role carries no promise or expectation of guaranteed employment for the entire term, extension of the term, or conversion to a full-time or permanent position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hours: approximately 20-25 hours per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Compensation: hourly, $40-$60 per hour, depending on experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start date: as soon as practicable, targeting third or fourth week of September 2026&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Los Angeles, CA&lt;/li&gt;
