&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SHEGLAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2019, SHEGLAM has quickly become one of the fastest growing beauty brands. Boasting a vibrant community of over 16 million followers across multiple social media platforms, SHEGLAM is globally recognized as one of the most popular brands among Gen Z. At SHEGLAM, we’re here to help you explore and express the style that feels most like you—confident, comfortable, and entirely your own. Now, with SHEGLAM Hair, we’re stepping up our game in hairstyling and haircare, so you can dive even deeper into your journey of self-discovery with a little extra hair flair. Since the launch of the SHEGLAM Hair line, we’ve achieved double-digit monthly sales growth and expanded our reach to 150 countries. Our products are loved by top influencers and media outlets worldwide. At SHEGLAM, we are committed to recognizing and nurturing talent and potential. Learn more about us at: https://www.sheglam.com/.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
