&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re seeking a full-time Marketing Intern (SHEGLAM Hair) (official title: Intern) for our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Los Angeles-based &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;corporate office. This role will s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;upport the day-to-day management and growth of SHEGLAM Hair’s TikTok and Instagram accounts through content production, publishing, trend research, and data-driven optimization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with influencer training and campaign communication, including sharing product information, key selling points, and campaign guidelines with creators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support live-streaming initiatives by assisting with product communication and coordination with live-streaming agencies to help ensure smooth execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional communication with influencers, agencies, and internal teams, as well as other marketing initiatives as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and edit social-first content for TikTok and Instagram, including TikTok posts, Stories, Reels, and other short-form content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Source and adapt viral/trending content, sounds, formats, and cultural moments that are relevant to the SHEGLAM Hair brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the day-to-day publishing of content, including captions, hashtags, tagging, and platform-specific formatting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor social media performance and identify high-performing and underperforming content, providing recommendations for future content optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support community engagement by responding to comments and interacting with relevant creators and accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain awareness of TikTok and Instagram trends, beauty/hair content, and creator culture to continuously bring fresh content ideas to the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support other social media and influencer marketing initiatives as needed, including creator outreach, maintaining creator relationships, and coordinating cross-creator collaborations and account-to-account engagement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
