&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re seeking a full-time Senior Fashion Designer for our&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Los Angeles-based &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;corporate office. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;NYA SZN is a next-generation women’s fashion brand under SHEIN built to deliver elevated, fashion-forward product with a distinct point of view. Rooted in confidence, culture, and modern femininity, NYA SZN is designed for the customer who wants trend relevance, premium-looking product, and statement style at accessible prices. As the brand enters an accelerated growth phase, we are seeking a Senior Fashion Designer to play a critical role in shaping the next chapter of NYA SZN. This individual will bring strong creative instincts, commercial awareness, and executional excellence to help elevate the assortment across ready-to-wear categories, while adding valuable expertise in denim-driven product development and category expansion. We are looking for a designer who can build original product, identify growth opportunities, and translate trends into compelling assortments that drive results. This is a high-impact role for someone excited to build, influence, and help scale a growing brand.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
