&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We’re seeking a full-time Trade Compliance Manager for our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Los Angeles-based &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;corporate office. The Trade Compliance Manager serves as the key advisor on global trade compliance, helping business teams navigate cross-border requirements, regulatory risks, and compliance strategies. This role monitors changes in trade laws and tariffs, supports audits and investigations, strengthens policies and internal controls, partners with cross-functional teams to integrate compliance into operations, and helps oversee import/export, customs, and licensing activities across the Americas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
